menu "Irrigation MVP"
config IRRIGATION_SIMULATION
    bool "Run explicit synthetic fixtures (no physical GPIO)"
    default n
    help
        Synthetic input only. Requires sim- device and experiment identities.
config IRRIGATION_PHYSICAL_ENABLED
    bool "Enable physical actuation (unavailable until hardware validation)"
    default n
    help
        No physical drivers or validated circuit configuration exist yet.
        Selecting this option intentionally fails compilation.
endmenu
